      "atomicityContentDecision": "keep",
      "atomicityReason": "One connected information-flow explanation from supplied DNA through mRNA to a polypeptide; transcription and translation are distinct subordinate stages whose connection is the assessed outcome. Isolated success in one stage is insufficient.",
      "memoryDecision": "no_memory_needed",
      "memoryReason": "With strand, code and cell-context aids the demanded performance is connected transformation/reasoning. The genetic-code table and terminology inventory are not unaided memory requirements.",
